        "title": "Critical Infrastructure Sectors",
        "category": "other"
      },
      {
        "text": "SNOMED International Snowstorm contains a reflected XSS vulnerability within the \"Web Route\" redirection functionality. The function does not properly validate user input, allowing an attacker to inject arbitrary JavaScript which will execute upon a target user navigating to a crafted, malicious link.",
        "title": "Risk Evaluation",
        "category": "summary"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fixed in 10.12.2. A backport fix is available in 10.9.3 for users unable to upgrade to 10.12.2.",
        "title": "Recommended Practices",
        "category": "general"
      },
      {
        "text": "United Kingdom",
        "title": "Company Headquarters Location",
        "category": "other"
      }
